# MMPose v0.29.0 (Apache 2.0) Ч модульный pose estimation.
#
# Ќј«Ќј„≈Ќ»≈:
#   - 2D body pose (COCO 17 keypoints).
#   - Face, hand, animal keypoints.
#   - Top-down и bottom-up пайплайны.
